# Only compiled output (out/) and packaging metadata should ship in the
# .vsix — everything else here is source/tooling that bloats the package
# (or, in the case of *.vsix, would recursively bundle a previous build of
# itself if a stale one is ever sitting in this directory again).
src/**
tsconfig.json
package-lock.json
*.vsix
.gitignore
**/*.map
.vscode-test/**
